  "html": "<h2>Where the Release Runs</h2>\n<div class=\"pic pic-c4\">\n  <svg class=\"pic-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 980 470\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"C4 system context of the release\"><defs><marker id=\"pic-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"context-stroke\"/></marker></defs><rect class=\"bound\" x=\"660\" y=\"14\" width=\"300\" height=\"426\" rx=\"14\"/><text class=\"bl\" x=\"672\" y=\"32\">Our own controls: HEART servers we run</text><g class=\"node person\"><circle class=\"shape\" cx=\"140\" cy=\"42\" r=\"12\"/><rect class=\"shape\" x=\"40\" y=\"54\" width=\"200\" height=\"66\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"140\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Release author</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"140\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\">writes the goal</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"140\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\">in plain words</text></g><g class=\"node system\"><rect class=\"shape\" x=\"330\" y=\"190\" width=\"220\" height=\"78\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"440\" y=\"219\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ARTIE, at the release desk</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"440\" y=\"233\" text-anchor=\"middle\">HEART client: walks the goal</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"440\" y=\"246\" text-anchor=\"middle\">once, then replays its script</text></g><g class=\"node ext\"><rect class=\"shape\" x=\"40\" y=\"320\" width=\"200\" height=\"66\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"140\" y=\"343\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Claude</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"140\" y=\"357\" text-anchor=\"middle\">reasons over the offers,</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"140\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\">during the walk only</text></g><g class=\"node doc\"><path class=\"shape\" d=\"M330 360h206l14 14v46h-220z\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"440\" y=\"386.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Kept script</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"440\" y=\"400.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">YAML, with pinned offers</text></g><g class=\"node system\" data-id=\"forge\"><rect class=\"shape\" x=\"680\" y=\"40\" width=\"260\" height=\"58\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"810\" y=\"59\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Forge gateway</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"810\" y=\"73\" text-anchor=\"middle\">HEART, in front of</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"810\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\">GitHub and GitLab</text></g><g class=\"node system\" data-id=\"watch\"><rect class=\"shape\" x=\"680\" y=\"118\" width=\"260\" height=\"58\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"810\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Watcher</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"810\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\">RISE: tells the desk</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"810\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\">when a resource offers an act</text></g><g class=\"node system\" data-id=\"ci\"><rect class=\"shape\" x=\"680\" y=\"196\" width=\"260\" height=\"58\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"810\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"middle\">CI wrapper</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"810\" y=\"229\" text-anchor=\"middle\">HEART, in front of Jenkins,</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"810\" y=\"242\" text-anchor=\"middle\">which builds and deploys</text></g><g class=\"node system\" data-id=\"preview\"><rect class=\"shape\" x=\"680\" y=\"274\" width=\"260\" height=\"58\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"810\" y=\"293\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Preview deployment</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"810\" y=\"307\" text-anchor=\"middle\">the built library app,</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"810\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\">where the smoke test runs</text></g><g class=\"node system\" data-id=\"dev\"><rect class=\"shape\" x=\"680\" y=\"352\" width=\"260\" height=\"58\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"810\" y=\"371\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Dev</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"810\" y=\"385\" text-anchor=\"middle\">HEART: environments,</text><text class=\"s\" x=\"810\" y=\"398\" text-anchor=\"middle\">promote a commit</text></g><g class=\"edge own\"><path d=\"M240 100 C300 110 330 160 380 188\" marker-end=\"url(#pic-arrow)\"/><text class=\"l\" x=\"300\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"middle\">the goal, plain text</text></g><g class=\"edge think dash\"><path d=\"M330 250 C290 280 270 320 242 340\" marker-end=\"url(#pic-arrow)\"/><text class=\"l\" x=\"250\" y=\"286\" text-anchor=\"middle\">walk: which offer?</text></g><g class=\"edge own\"><path d=\"M440 270 V356\" marker-end=\"url(#pic-arrow)\"/><text class=\"l\" x=\"448\" y=\"318\" text-anchor=\"start\">keeps, then replays</text></g><g class=\"edge heart\"><path d=\"M552 229 C600 229 620 69 678 69\" marker-end=\"url(#pic-arrow)\"/></g><g class=\"edge rise\"><path d=\"M552 229 C600 229 620 147 678 147\" marker-end=\"url(#pic-arrow)\"/></g><g class=\"edge heart\"><path d=\"M552 229 C600 229 620 225 678 225\" marker-end=\"url(#pic-arrow)\"/></g><g class=\"edge heart\"><path d=\"M552 229 C600 229 620 303 678 303\" marker-end=\"url(#pic-arrow)\"/></g><g class=\"edge heart\"><path d=\"M552 229 C600 229 620 381 678 381\" marker-end=\"url(#pic-arrow)\"/></g><text class=\"l\" x=\"610\" y=\"452\" text-anchor=\"middle\">HTTP: HEART and RISE</text></svg>\n</div>\n<p class=\"sq-key pic-key\"><span><b class=\"k-heart\">━</b> HEART</span><span><b class=\"k-rise\">━</b> RISE</span><span><b class=\"k-think\">┅</b> Claude, walk only</span><span><b class=\"k-own\">━</b> the desk's own</span></p>\n",
  "say": "Before the goal moves, here's where it runs. One person writes the goal in plain words. ARTIE, at the release desk, is the only client. Claude helps once, on the walk, and never again. Everything ARTIE talks to is a HEART server we run ourselves: the forge gateway in front of GitHub and GitLab, the watcher, the CI wrapper in front of Jenkins, the preview the build deploys, and Dev. Our own controls, in front of what we don't control.",
